# Linter for repo-level first-party tooling.
#
# fuzzing/ and scripts/ sit outside every service, so the per-service lint
# matrix in ci.yml cannot see them. Without this they are the only Python in
# the repo with no gate on it.
#
# Pinned to the version all four services/*/uv.lock files already resolve to,
# so the lint result does not depend on which lockfile happens to run first.
#
# Regenerate the hashed lock with:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.14 \
#     --output-file requirements/ci-ruff.txt requirements/ci-ruff.in
ruff==0.16.9